    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Hearthfyre Arsenal",
    "summary": "As [your Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) ends, each [objective marker](vsdata:core-rule/objectives) under your control outside your deployment zone earns you 1YP if an **IRON-MASTER** or **MEMNYR STRATEGIST** model of yours is in its range, up to 2YP per turn from this rule.\n\nIn [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), whenever one of your **BRÔKHYR**, **IRONKIN STEELJACKS** or **ARKANYST EVALUATOR** units is **selected to shoot**, if you spend 1YP, its models' attacks can re-roll 1s to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) for the rest of the phase.",
